    "description": "Sheaffer\nGold Plated\n32.4 grams\nThis vintage Sheaffer writing instrument set features a matching ballpoint pen and mechanical pencil adorned with an intricate chased floral scroll and grapevine motif. Produced in the United States, each piece showcases classic mid-century craftsmanship with Sheaffer's signature White Dot on the clip, housed in a satin-lined Reflections presentation case.\nTwo-piece set includes one ballpoint pen and one matching mechanical pencil\nDetailed all-over grapevine and scrolling acanthus leaf pattern with polished accents\nClassic Sheaffer White Dot pocket clips with spring mechanism\nEach writing instrument measures approximately 5 inches in length\nIncludes hardshell Reflections Fine Writing Instruments display box\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition with gentle surface wear consistent with age and light handling. Metal surfaces retain warm, even gold luster throughout the ornate chased detailing. Mechanical pencil and ballpoint components present intact. Pencil marked SHEAFFER U.S.A. and 12K G.F. with crown mark; pen marked SHEAFFER U.S.A. and 12K R.G.P. CASING with crown mark. Tested gold plated. Presentation case shows minor vintage shelf wear.\nWarehouse Location: Canton\nDue to our lighting, white glare lines may appear on items - This is NOT damage\nIf you have any questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item or general questions regarding and item, please click Contact Seller on the item page and send us a message. We are available to answer your questions Monday through Friday, 8 am - 3:00 pm, EST.\n* For combined shipping policy see the shipping tab.\nSome items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nSee Photos. Items sold as-is.",
